                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eaa92c97-c191-32c5-92ed-93b85c688f28",
                        "entry_id": "3041a5ab-4f81-31c8-872e-e96d71f432a6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A user who prefers such interface designs, typically framed as naive or ignorant of the underlying technology."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory",
                            "masculine",
                            "slang",
                            "strong",
                            "uncommon"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "40a90ef2-4e5a-435e-98e2-b9f46a364529",
                                "sense_id": "eaa92c97-c191-32c5-92ed-93b85c688f28",
                                "text": "Na und? Die Entscheidung dafür oder dagegen obliegt jedem Einzelnen - manchen ist der Sicherheitsaspekt wichtiger, andere möchten manche Effekte nicht verpassen. Kein Grund, diese gleich pejorativ als \"Klickibuntis\" abzutun.",
                                "translation": "So what? That decision should be up to everyone individually - for some, the security aspect is more important, others wouldn't want to miss certain effects. No reason to just pejoratively dismiss them all as \"button-clickers\".",
                                "english": "So what? That decision should be up to everyone individually - for some, the security aspect is more important, others wouldn't want to miss certain effects. No reason to just pejoratively dismiss them all as \"button-clickers\"."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "db841de7-c160-42a8-8e9b-e3a8e30fc519",
                                "sense_id": "eaa92c97-c191-32c5-92ed-93b85c688f28",
                                "text": "Aber nicht wenige wandeln sich von argwöhnischen Kommandozeilen-Hackern zu seligen Klickibuntis, sobald das Prädikat \"OpenSource\" drauf steht.",
                                "translation": "But quite a few turn from mistrustful command line hackers to blissful naive button-clickers as soon as something is certified \"OpenSource\".",
                                "english": "But quite a few turn from mistrustful command line hackers to blissful naive button-clickers as soon as something is certified \"OpenSource\"."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
